  "label": "Misogynistic Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that women in certain regions (implied to be South Asian) are inherently associated with prostitution or moral degradation. This stereotype is used to dehumanize and objectify women, particularly those of color, by linking their appearance or attire to sexual availability or criminality. The image of the women, combined with the label, reinforces this harmful trope.",
